cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "freeGon Grid Matcher"
abstract: >-
  A tool for spatially matching transmission line data between JAO
  (Joint Allocation Office / CORE-TSO) and PyPSA (Python for Power
  System Analysis) formats. Provides automated spatial matching,
  manual override support, electrical parameter transfer, transformer
  matching, and interactive HTML visualizations.
